 "titulo": "You built a house in earthquake country 🇯🇵 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "YOU BUILT A QUAKE-PROOF HOUSE",
 "descripcion": "From a house that cracks in every quake to one that floats while the ground shakes, the way Japan does it.\n\nWhat should we build next?\n\n#engineering #howitworks #earthquake #shorts",
